Qjx3gol5ufqFIlxYVxoZqBcZohB_nexrk8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwRuO0Ixn8oU5_JvGExi3HHqRn1Kn49LiBbjTde8-LQwQ&oe=69BEAA1C"}, {"file_name": "ss5.png", "id": "217044561372189", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035396_217044564705522_2329637064441792377_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=clIf_unrPXUQ7kNvwHzF_jj&_nc_oc=Adk2Sqc9Ff5oNhu5LDGkpFAs-wgEsf97jSCVCzInHWpm4xt26aXnqbymu2D0Xt9WijE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyctIovl59QivKJpPyK5fOtqulEDqOD5eXRZHmJUA33jg&oe=69BEA3E0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "VRBOX_CoverTrailer.png", "id": "680194554042786", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001706_680194557376119_7857106052663886372_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8djaxgV1KU4Q7kNvwG7cH85&_nc_oc=AdkOXUB-9oqmuu3tgrS4mxtsJP27udnOGvgYAjZbx-PjB0R3hg18Ygp66P0pIT3_Wdg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afzx8GYwm1Ngf4CBdw1lTIzcOxM0NF7nQdXls_TdBWJZjA&oe=69BEA9A9"}, "display_name": "VRBOX", "keywords": [], "long_description": "VRBOX is a sandbox game based on Radgoll with euphoria style, shooting from weapons, and gore.\n\nThe game contains blood effects and splatters on walls.\n\nThe game doesn't include a story mode, which is not planned yet.\n\nFEATURES:\n\nSandbox mode: you can create any NPC, such as an enemy NPC or a normal NPC that can't damage you and doesn't have any weapons.\n\nWave Level: In this mode, enemies will eventually spawn, and your mission is to survive as long as you can.\n\nClear Mode: In this mode, you have to kill all the enemies in the area.\n\n\nThe VRBOX doesn't have many weapons for now, but I'll update the game with new weapons and levels.", "short_description": "A sandbox game based on ragdolls and shooting"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/15FFzkA-9mcaz6qIIRLM0owTb2iC9zYFhljUh8NM